# Exports and renders. Audio is large, and it is NOT regenerable: record every
# kept take's engine ID or link in its project's Takes table, and back the file
# up somewhere other than this repo.
out/
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.flac

# Render files (`projects/<slug>.md`, the ACE-Step song format) stay local:
# they hold unreleased lyrics. A released song's folder, `projects/<slug>/`,
# is committed. `examples/night-shift.md` is the committed render reference.
projects/*.md
!projects/README.md

